      "id": 39894,
      "name": "lugaru",
      "username": "lugaru",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/{size}/2767_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-10-12T12:42:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think I'm there as lugaru, for some reason I have not played in a few weeks (actually that reason is ftl, xcom, etc).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In order I am:</p><p>AP Teemo: very challenging and rewarding strategy based character. Also nothing funnier than doing well and seeing dps carries RUN AWAY FROM A TINY YORDLE.</p><p>Casipea: because everyone under estimates her and she can win a duel if you are prepared and disrupt a team fight.</p><p>Maokai: with no boots and almost pure tank. A dumb team will hit you all day long while your team mates pick up kills.</p><p>Skarner: Jungle with frequent draging ganks.</p><p>Trundle: I love him but he is just not as powerful as most other champions.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:13:36.495Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
